      "hash": "d0f95bb52b5c7550",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main_1010_sys_01",
      "hash": "1651f10d6b07e451",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 5]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main_1010_sys_02",
      "hash": "1651ee0d6b07df38",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_04",
      "hash": "313c7eb68af79e19",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_01",
      "hash": "27012684004f6025",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這隻拉普拉斯已經上年紀了，\\n但牠還是很漂亮對吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_09",
      "hash": "27012e84004f6dbd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我們以前曾經一起乘風破浪，\\n在無邊無際的大海上冒險呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main1010_poke_n_01",
      "hash": "0fbf99abdfd06be7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "拉普拉斯「斯～斯～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_02",
      "hash": "27012384004f5b0c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "牠現在已經不太能游泳了……\\c\\n所以我以後也會在這裡，\\n一直一直陪在牠身邊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_03",
      "hash": "27012484004f5cbf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "謝謝[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的傾聽。"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_10",
      "hash": "2704ab84005277fb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "為了答謝[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳，\\n就讓我教[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘術「水上飄」[VAR COLOR(0000)]吧！\\r\\n學會這招就能在水上移動喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_04",
      "hash": "27012184004f57a6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哈哈！[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的[VAR POKNAME(0002)]\\n想跟[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一起學是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_11",
      "hash": "2704aa8400527648",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "牠不是水屬性寶可夢，\\n不知道能不能學會呢……？"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main1010_partner_a_01",
      "hash": "f1cf0975034c2acf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "皮卡～皮！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main1010_partner_b_01",
      "hash": "f30a517a2a59c078",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "伊～布伊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_05",
      "hash": "27012284004f5959",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "牠跟拉普拉斯一樣\\n有一雙動人的眼睛啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_12",
      "hash": "2704ad8400527b61",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好啦好啦！我知道了！\\n那我要來教囉！"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main1010_partner_a_02",
      "hash": "f1cf0a75034c2c82",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "皮卡皮！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main1010_partner_b_02",
      "hash": "f30a547a2a59c591",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "布伊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_06",
      "hash": "27011f84004f5440",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……聽好了，首先要\\n在水面上保持平衡！\\c\\n把重心放低，\\n用上半身保持身體穩定！"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main1010_sys_n_01",
      "hash": "5b153dffd0bef2dd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0003)]學會了\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘術「水上飄」[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_07",
      "hash": "27012084004f55f3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "很好！非常優秀！\\n那個衝浪板也送給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_13",
      "hash": "2704ac84005279ae",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要用它乘風破浪，\\n到更遠的地方去喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_08",
      "hash": "27012d84004f6c0a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎，[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳也要和[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的[VAR POKNAME(0002)]\\n永遠相親相愛喔！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_1010_max",
